-ill-001-3d6c234599c4.webp","image_alt":"天蓝底，蝴蝶结礼盒，上方英文PREPARING GIFTS，下方中文准备礼物","start_sec":24.65310657596372,"end_sec":27.93328798185941,"duration_sec":3.280181405895693},{"id":"G002","title":"标题停留","chapter":"act-1","lines":[],"image_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-001-3d6c234599c4-full.webp","display_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-001-3d6c234599c4.webp","image_alt":"天蓝底，蝴蝶结礼盒，上方英文PREPARING GIFTS，下方中文准备礼物","start_sec":27.93328798185941,"end_sec":29.13328798185941,"duration_sec":1.1999999999999993},{"id":"G009","title":"送宾果一个布鲁伊","chapter":"act-1","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L012","speaker":"班迪特","text":"老板想先做什么礼物？","start_sec":29.13328798185941,"end_sec":31.68748299319728},{"id":"GIFT-L013","speaker":"布鲁伊","text":"做个我，送给宾果！","start_sec":31.867482993197278,"end_sec":33.655419501133785}],"image_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-009-5cdcc8ca6fa0-full.webp","display_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-009-5cdcc8ca6fa0.webp","image_alt":"第一件选什么","start_sec":29.13328798185941,"end_sec":33.835419501133785,"duration_sec":4.702131519274374},{"id":"G010","title":"请模特站好","chapter":"act-1","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L014","speaker":"班迪特","text":"模特请站好！","start_sec":33.835419501133785,"end_sec":36.505714285714284},{"id":"GIFT-L111","speaker":"宾果","text":"姐姐，再神气一点！","start_sec":36.68571428571428,"end_sec":38.96126984126984}],"image_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-010-03e098d78516-full.webp","display_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-010-03e098d78516.webp","image_alt":"布鲁伊在地毯上摆神气模特姿势，宾果指导姐姐，爸爸和妈妈笑着配合；打印机与平板在右侧桌上。","start_sec":33.835419501133785,"end_sec":39.14126984126984,"duration_sec":5.305850340136054},{"id":"G011","title":"神气的小耳朵","chapter":"act-1","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L015","speaker":"班迪特","text":"瞧这两只神气的小耳朵！","start_sec":39.14126984126984,"end_sec":42.69392290249433}],"image_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-011-1a5b15ea52c4-full.webp","display_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-011-1a5b15ea52c4.webp","image_alt":"逐层预览","start_sec":39.14126984126984,"end_sec":42.87392290249433,"duration_sec":3.7326530612244895},