s/gift-ill-016-559a93c3ea6d.webp","image_alt":"爸爸确认凉下来了","start_sec":55.72789115646258,"end_sec":59.49537414965987,"duration_sec":3.7674829931972837},{"id":"G017","title":"掌心里的小布鲁伊","chapter":"act-1","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L020","speaker":"宾果","text":"布鲁伊，你变成小蓝莓啦！","start_sec":59.49537414965987,"end_sec":61.80575963718821}],"image_path":"assets/lossless/02A-miniature-palm-b565903a657d-full.webp","display_path":"assets/02A-miniature-palm.webp","image_alt":"已冷却的微型布鲁伊放在班迪特掌心，布鲁伊和宾果凑近看","start_sec":59.49537414965987,"end_sec":61.98575963718821,"duration_sec":2.490385487528343},{"id":"G018","title":"旅行装布鲁伊","chapter":"act-1","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L108","speaker":"布鲁伊","text":"我可不是蓝莓！","start_sec":61.98575963718821,"end_sec":63.378956916099774},{"id":"GIFT-L021","speaker":"班迪特","text":"这是旅行装布鲁伊！","start_sec":63.49895691609977,"end_sec":66.2853514739229},{"id":"GIFT-L022","speaker":"布鲁伊","text":"那我就能陪你到处玩啦！","start_sec":66.46535147392291,"end_sec":68.97310657596371}],"image_path":"assets/lossless/02B-miniature-joke-af3d344ebe18-full.webp","display_path":"assets/02B-miniature-joke.webp","image_alt":"班迪特把小模型举到脸边讲旅行装的笑话，布鲁伊和宾果笑起来","start_sec":61.98575963718821,"end_sec":69.15310657596372,"duration_sec":7.167346938775509},{"id":"G019","title":"再准备一份惊喜","chapter":"act-1","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L023","speaker":"奇莉","text":"下午还要见朋友呢，礼物小店忙得过来吗？","start_sec":69.15310657596372,"end_sec":73.4952380952381},{"id":"GIFT-L024","speaker":"布鲁伊","text":"当然！我还要准备一份惊喜。","start_sec":73.6752380952381,"end_sec":76.14816326530612},{"id":"GIFT-L025","speaker":"班迪特","text":"收到，我们再接一单！","start_sec":76.32816326530612,"end_sec":78.71981859410431}],"image_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-019-af40e5dcbdd7-full.webp","display_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-019-af40e5dcbdd7.webp","image_alt":"下午去见朋友","start_sec":69.15310657596372,"end_sec":78.8998185941043,"duration_sec":9.746712018140585},{"id":"G020","title":"让朋友也笑起来","chapter":"act-1","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L026","speaker":"旁白","text":"这次，她想让朋友也笑起来。","start_sec":