球袋，乔治抱着恐龙，足球藏在长椅下。","start_sec":237.45419501133787,"end_sec":241.99378684807257,"duration_sec":4.539591836734701},{"id":"G060","title":"佩奇请君君帮忙","chapter":"act-4","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L078","speaker":"佩奇","text":"君君，你看见它躲到哪里了吗？","start_sec":241.99378684807257,"end_sec":245.3374603174603}],"image_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-060-44fad4b2d494-full.webp","display_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-060-44fad4b2d494.webp","image_alt":"佩奇举着空球袋看向观众，邀请君君帮忙找球。","start_sec":241.99378684807257,"end_sec":245.51746031746032,"duration_sec":3.523673469387745},{"id":"G061","title":"给君君找球时间","chapter":"act-4","lines":[],"image_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-060-44fad4b2d494-full.webp","display_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-060-44fad4b2d494.webp","image_alt":"佩奇举着空球袋看向观众，邀请君君帮忙找球。","answer_wait_sec":4,"answer_prompt":"君君，你看见它躲到哪里了吗？","start_sec":245.51746031746032,"end_sec":249.51746031746032,"duration_sec":4.0},{"id":"G062","title":"乔治发现了","chapter":"act-4","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L079","speaker":"乔治","text":"我看见了，在椅子下面！","start_sec":249.51746031746032,"end_sec":252.6637641723356}],"image_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-062-692e67695563-full.webp","display_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-062-692e67695563.webp","image_alt":"乔治蹲下指向長椅下露出的足球，佩奇顺着他的手看过去。","start_sec":249.51746031746032,"end_sec":252.8437641723356,"duration_sec":3.3263038548752775},{"id":"G063","title":"佩奇抱好足球","chapter":"act-4","lines":[{"id":"GIFT-L080","speaker":"佩奇","text":"原来躲在椅子下面。","start_sec":252.8437641723356,"end_sec":255.35151927437641},{"id":"GIFT-L081","speaker":"猪爸爸","text":"还没开赛，它先玩起躲猫猫了！","start_sec":255.53151927437642,"end_sec":259.1654421768707},{"id":"GIFT-L082","speaker":"佩奇","text":"这次我要抱紧你。","start_sec":259.34544217687073,"end_sec":261.81836734693877}],"image_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-063-b9fb8dc370d1-full.webp","display_path":"/ebook/assets/gift-ill-063-b9fb8dc370d1.webp","image_alt":"佩奇抱回足球，猪爸爸收起空球袋和画夹，乔治开心地抱着恐龙。","start_sec":252.8437641723356,"end_sec":261.9983673469388,"duration_sec":9.154603174603182},{